    "en": {
      "trackName": "Push boxes: Logic puzzle",
      "description": "Push boxes onto their targets. Sounds simple — until it isn't.\nSokoban is one of the most elegant logic games ever invented: you can only push boxes, never pull. One wrong move and you've painted yourself into a corner. Every level is a small, satisfying puzzle that rewards patience and planning over luck or speed.\n\n7,814 LEVELS. ALL YOURS.\n\nFrom gentle warm-ups to fiendishly tricky brain-benders — there's a reason only 15 players have solved more than 400. Are you next?\n\nMADE FOR EVERY MOMENT\n\nGot 5 minutes on the bus? A long flight ahead? This game plays beautifully offline on iPhone, iPad, Apple Watch, Apple TV, and Mac — your puzzle collection goes wherever you do.\n\nWHY PLAYERS LOVE IT\n\n→ No timers. No pressure. Just pure logic.\n→ Levels up to 10×10 — deceptively complex layouts\n→ Completely offline — no Wi-Fi required, ever\n→ Universal purchase — one game, all your Apple devices\n\nNo energy bars. No pay-to-win. No distractions. Just you and the box.\n\n\"The simplest games are the hardest to master.\"",
      "releaseNotes": "Fresh new look, full 3D scene — pinch to zoom, two fingers to rotate.\nTop 20 spots are waiting. Are you one of them?\n\nEnjoyed the game? Leave us a rating — it truly helps!",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/push-boxes-logic-puzzle/id977326353?uo=4",
      "formattedPrice": "$2.99",
      "sellerName": "Valerii Andrusyk",
